EXAMPLE STUB. To use: copy to .claude/rules/<topic>.md (drop the .example suffix), edit `paths:`,
fill in, and delete this comment. The .example suffix keeps the stub from loading; delete it if unused.

A rule WITHOUT `paths:` frontmatter loads EVERY session, which defeats the point.
A rule with `paths:` loads only when Claude opens a matching file.
Write rules that can be checked in a diff ("prices always include tax"), not vibes ("be careful").
